msgid "Oh! Are you the man from the Dragon Palace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Can you show me toward this guy you're all freaking\r\n"
"out about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"He's sitting right over there. He has a knife and a stun\r\n"
"gun... and won't say a single word even when we try to talk\r\n"
"to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "All right. Leave him to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Please handle this quickly! The girls are shaken..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
